PDB ABI: `Release/Dib.obj` records `S_LPROC32` at section offset `00039B50`,
size `0x2A`, type `0x2294`. The procedure has a `void` return, `d` and `s`
parameters of type `unsigned char*` (`T_32PUCHAR`), and `len` of type `long`
